===Etymology===
From ''lau-'' + {{m|et|päev}}. The element ''lau-'' is from {{der|et|gem-pro|*laugōz dagaz}}. Compare {{cog|non|laugardagr}}, {{cog|gmq-osw|lögherdagher}}, {{cog|fi|lauantai}}. Cognate to {{cog|vot|laukopäivä}} and {{cog|izh|laukopäivä}}.

